\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Build with AI: Code for Communities is a Google Cloud hackathon that brings together developers from across India to build AI-powered solutions for the challenges that matter most, right here at home. Healthcare supply chains. Climate resilience. Food security. Digital public infrastructure. Problems India's own cities, states, and communities face every day \'97 and need builders to help solve.\cb1 \
